{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12114270","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12114270","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1211427001:0":{"text":"그래, 그래. 넌 꽤 똑똑해 보이는데, 설마 바보처럼 너희 동료를 믿고 있는 건 아니겠지?","source_cn":"行了行了，我看你挺机灵的，应该不会傻到相信自己的笨蛋队友吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07326FDEA2C9CC27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211427002:0":{"text":"그 녀석들은 이미 내가 다 처리했어. 당하기 전에 바로 널 팔아버리더라고.","source_cn":"他们已经被干掉了，被干掉之前还顺手把你卖了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69EBE810F71C8203","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211427003:1":{"text":"너도 같은 처지가 되고 싶지 않으면 얌전히 말 들어.","source_cn":"你要是不想落个同样的下场，就乖乖听话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3736C407B66FF1DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211427004:1":{"text":"뭘 알고 싶은 거지...","source_cn":"你们想问什么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2627F73F5C293112","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211427005:1":{"text":"네 동료가 그러는데, 특별한 문을 열 수 있다며?","source_cn":"你的好队友说，你能打开那些特殊的门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8736816D342A4696","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211427006:0":{"text":"흐흐흐... 맞아.","source_cn":"呵呵呵……不错，我可以。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26D6F248B2B45EB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211427007:0":{"text":"그런데 조금 전에 너희가 갑자기 날 공격하는 바람에 열쇠가 냄비 속으로 빠져 버렸어. 지금쯤이면 아마 쇳물로 변했을 거야.","source_cn":"但是你们刚才突然闯过来攻击我，我一哆嗦，钥匙掉进坩埚里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C22CEB0C6769CD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211427008:0":{"text":"열쇠가 한 자루일 리 없잖아? 어서 예비 열쇠를 내놔!","source_cn":"钥匙不可能只有一把，赶紧把备用钥匙交出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x972F23793D023649","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211427009:1":{"text":"예비 열쇠야, 당연히 있지. 선장한테 말이야. 가서 달라고 해 봐.","source_cn":"备用钥匙当然有，只不过，在船长手里。恐怕你们得去找他要了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F65B22354548A78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211427010:0":{"text":"넌 좀 맞아야...","source_cn":"我看 你是欠揍——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68B6F02644902728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211427011:0":{"text":"진정해요, 신밧드! 마스터에게 맡기세요!","source_cn":"冷静，辛巴达！剩下的交给梅林吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9148D1793E4BEDB7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"진정해요, 신밧드! 마스터에게 맡기세요!","female":"진정해요, 신밧드! 마스터에게 맡기세요!","variant_male_record_index":"130688","variant_female_record_index":"130689","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1211427012:1":{"text":"열쇠를 만드는 건 마스터에게 식은 죽 먹기니까요!","source_cn":"重铸钥匙而已，这对梅林来说易如反掌！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8EAA91AA478FC455","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"열쇠를 만드는 건 마스터에게 식은 죽 먹기니까요!","female":"열쇠를 만드는 건 마스터에게 식은 죽 먹기니까요!","variant_male_record_index":"130690","variant_female_record_index":"130691","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:胆怯的死潮法师":{"text":"죽음의 함대 연금술사","source":"胆怯的死潮法师","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}